{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"外出ると\n風の強さに\n驚いた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！52回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nmizu-mizuさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、今日と\n風が強くてびっくり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外で撮影が多かったから\nぞんぶんに風を浴びれました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、少し弱めてもいいよ？風さん。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影の待ち時間で\n絢音ちゃんとみり愛と純奈と\nカメラのアプリで遊びました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛はいつも\n新しいものを教えてくれます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その、アプリだとか\n新作のグルメの話だったり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが現役高校生！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音ちゃんは、\n少し変わってます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑い方も変わってるし\n笑うタイミングとかも変わってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音のブログのシンプルさは\nとても絢音らしくて好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの妹！ってかんじ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈は、本当にノリがよくて\n純奈の周りにはいつも自然と人が集まってくる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰にでも合わせられる純奈は\n乃木坂1空気の読めるメンバー！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はお菓子を食べてる私の前で\nお菓子は本当にモンスター\nお菓子たち本当にやばいからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、言ってたからモンスター？って聞いたら\nカロリーの高いものをモンスターと言ってるみたいでした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットに対する純奈のストイックさが\nほしいこの頃。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人への近道の衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいくてすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆BARIさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！\n何枚目の衣装すき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎衣装は、表題曲だと\nおいでシャンプー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲だと春のメロディー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服だと3rd・7th・11th！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、大人への近道の衣装！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆だっちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁最近見た夢は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎気持ち良く走ってる夢！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ともきさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ぼむ まだ買ってません泣\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎それは、もう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オコだぞっ٩(๑`^´๑)۶！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆カレーうどんが大好きさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁カレーはどういうのが好きですか？？\n具であったり、ルーの感じとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎具は食感があまり残ってないクタクタがすきで、ルーはサラサラよりドロドロがすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆しみーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁プレイボーイの物語続きが気になるから次も早く読みたい。\nあれって別の人ってことで物語が繋がるの？\nそれとも日奈子が別の名前になるってこと？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎別のメンバーだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私含めた4人は同じ高校！\nって設定！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはもう言えません！！！笑\nちゃんと4人分みてね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あいてぃーK☆サンエトさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは何があったら、もう春だなーって思う？\nやっぱ桜かなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎桜もそうだね！ピクニックもそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、暖かい風も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のきいちゃんにきいちゃおう！は\nここまでー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/11/6463590/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  シャンデリア★りゅうたさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎乃木坂メンバーの\n推しグッズなにか持ってる～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎たくさん持ってます！！！\nＴシャツとかタオルとか生写真とか\nいろいろあるけど\nトレーディングカードは全メンバーのもってるよ٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(210)  みすたーこんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎BOMBで「らりんを囲む会」っていう特集があったけど、その中で、きいちゃんが怒って許しません！っていう記事があったけど、いまは何か気持ちに変化はあった？\nあの発表の日に自分も武道館にいたからすごい気になったし、きいちゃんがそう思う気持ちも分かる気がしたから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎今もらりんさんと会うと\n私はまだ怒ってます！と伝えるし\n卒業されることを考えると\n涙が溢れてきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、だいすきならりんさんだから\n素敵な形で夢への一歩を踏み出してほしいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢への一歩を踏むために\n私たちがしっかりして安心してもらい\n笑って背中を押せるように\nらりんさんの卒業ライブは\n今までのライブの中で一番\n素敵なものにしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんがだいすきだから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  マッコウ@さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"